        "type": "text",
        "info": {
          "notes": "For municipalities with provincially assigned housing targets, there are four possible housing target statuses:\r\n\r\n* a municipality which has not achieved at least 80% of their annual housing target will have a status of 'not met'\r\n* a municipality which has achieved at least 80% of their annual housing target will have a status of 'on track '\r\n* a municipality which has achieved their annual housing target (100%) will have a status of 'met'\r\n* a municipality which has achieved more than exceeded their annual housing target (+100% or more) will have a status of 'exceeded'\r\n\r\nMunicipalities without a provincially assigned housing target will have a status of ‘not applicable.’",
